<title>PHILIPPINES: SPI TECH DECLARES 16 CTV CASH DIVIDEND.</title>
<headline>SPI TECH DECLARES 16 CTV CASH DIVIDEND.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>SPI Technologies Inc said on Tuesday its board of directors approved a cash dividend of 16 centavos per share.</p>
<p>The dividend will cover stockholders on record as of September 11. The payment date has been set on October 10.</p>
<p>The company is engaged in the production and export of computer data bases.</p>
